### API Test Collection for Phase 2 Enhancements
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension or similar tools
###
### Instructions:
### 1. Replace {{token}} with your actual JWT token
### 2. Replace {{base_url}} with your API URL (http://localhost:8000)
### 3. Run tests in order

@base_url = http://localhost:8000
@token = YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### SETUP: Health Check
GET {{base_url}}/health

### SETUP: Create Test User
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "country": "DE"
}

### Save the token from response and update @token above

### ========================================
### TEST 1: Create Vegan Recipe
### ========================================

POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/recipes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Vegan Buddha Bowl",
  "ingredients": ["quinoa", "chickpeas", "kale", "tahini", "lemon"],
  "instructions": "Cook quinoa. Mix with chickpeas, kale, and tahini dressing.",
  "prep_time": 15,
  "cook_time": 25,
  "servings": 2,
  "dietary_tags": ["vegan", "gluten_free"],
  "nutrition": {"calories": 450},
  "source_url": "https://test.com/vegan-bowl-1"
}

### ========================================
### TEST 2: Create Vegetarian Recipe
### ========================================

POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/recipes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Vegetarian Pizza",
  "ingredients": ["pizza dough", "mozzarella", "mushrooms", "bell peppers"],
  "instructions": "Top dough with cheese and vegetables. Bake.",
  "prep_time": 15,
  "cook_time": 20,
  "servings": 2,
  "dietary_tags": ["vegetarian"],
  "nutrition": {"calories": 520},
  "source_url": "https://test.com/veggie-pizza-1"
}

### ========================================
### TEST 3: Create Regular Recipe with Meat
### ========================================

POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/recipes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Chicken Salad",
  "ingredients": ["chicken breast", "lettuce", "tomatoes", "ranch"],
  "instructions": "Grill chicken. Toss with salad.",
  "prep_time": 10,
  "cook_time": 15,
  "servings": 2,
  "dietary_tags": [],
  "nutrition": {"calories": 350},
  "source_url": "https://test.com/chicken-salad-1"
}

### ========================================
### TEST 4: Create Meal Plan with Vegan Filter
### ========================================

POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/meal-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_date": "2025-11-25",
  "num_days": 3,
  "num_people": 2,
  "dietary_restrictions": ["vegan"],
  "meals_per_day": 3
}

### Expected: Only vegan recipes in response
### Verify: Check that all recipes have "vegan" in dietary_tags

### ========================================
### TEST 5: Create Meal Plan with Vegetarian Filter
### ========================================

POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/meal-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_date": "2025-11-26",
  "num_days": 3,
  "num_people": 2,
  "dietary_restrictions": ["vegetarian"],
  "meals_per_day": 3
}

### Expected: Vegetarian AND vegan recipes (vegan is subset of vegetarian)
### Verify: No meat recipes

### ========================================
### TEST 6: Create Meal Plan with Multiple Restrictions
### ========================================

POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/meal-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_date": "2025-11-27",
  "num_days": 3,
  "num_people": 2,
  "dietary_restrictions": ["vegan", "gluten_free"],
  "meals_per_day": 3
}

### Expected: Only recipes with BOTH vegan AND gluten_free tags
### Verify: All recipes are vegan AND gluten-free

### ========================================
### TEST 7: Create Meal Plan with Excluded Ingredient
### ========================================

POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/meal-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_date": "2025-11-28",
  "num_days": 3,
  "num_people": 2,
  "excluded_ingredients": ["chicken"],
  "meals_per_day": 3
}

### Expected: No recipes containing "chicken" in ingredients
### Verify: Check ingredients array in each recipe

### ========================================
### TEST 8: Create Meal Plan with Calorie Target
### ========================================

POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/meal-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_date": "2025-11-29",
  "num_days": 3,
  "num_people": 2,
  "target_calories_per_day": 2000,
  "meals_per_day": 3
}

### Expected: total_calories should be around 6000 (3 days * 2000 cal/day)
### Verify: Check total_calories in response

### ========================================
### TEST 9: Create Second Meal Plan (Variety Test)
### ========================================
### Create this AFTER Test 8 to verify variety feature

POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/meal-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_date": "2025-12-02",
  "num_days": 3,
  "num_people": 2,
  "meals_per_day": 3
}

### Expected: Different recipes than Test 8 (variety feature)
### Verify: Compare recipe IDs with previous meal plan

### ========================================
### TEST 10: Get Meal Plan Details
### ========================================
### Replace {id} with meal plan ID from previous response

GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/meal-plans/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected: Detailed view with days, meals, and statistics
### Verify: days array, statistics object

### ========================================
### TEST 11: List All Meal Plans
### ========================================

GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/meal-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected: Array of all meal plans for user
### Verify: Multiple plans visible

### ========================================
### TEST 12: Generate Grocery Cart
### ========================================
### Replace {id} with meal plan ID

POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/meal-plans/{id}/grocery-cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected: Grocery cart with aggregated ingredients
### Verify: total_items > 0, status = "active"

### ========================================
### TEST 13: Delete Meal Plan
### ========================================
### Replace {id} with meal plan ID

DELETE {{base_url}}/api/v1/meal-plans/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected: 204 No Content
### Verify: Plan is deleted

### ========================================
### TEST 14: Error Case - Impossible Constraints
### ========================================

POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/meal-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_date": "2025-12-01",
  "num_days": 30,
  "num_people": 2,
  "dietary_restrictions": ["vegan"],
  "excluded_ingredients": ["beans", "lentils", "tofu", "quinoa", "rice"],
  "meals_per_day": 3
}

### Expected: 500 error "No suitable recipes found"
### Verify: Error message is clear

### ========================================
### TEST 15: Invalid Days (Validation Error)
### ========================================

POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/meal-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_date": "2025-12-01",
  "num_days": 50,
  "num_people": 2,
  "meals_per_day": 3
}

### Expected: 422 Validation Error (max days is 30)
### Verify: Error details
